Description: An R interface to AusTraits, the Australian plant trait database. `austraits` loads releases of AusTraits by version number and maps trait data over Australia. The functions to access, explore and wrangle data come from `traits.use`, which works on any traits.build relational database; `austraits` re-exports them, so code written for earlier versions keeps working.
